      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-12-24_WidnesExaminer_art0031" n="art0031">
        <head>THR NRW FRRNOH RISHIMY.</head>
        <p>THR NRW FRRNOH RISHIMY.</p>
        <p>I II ERA Plol\ 7 g his successful aid highly • popular remedy, as etn- Nryod in the Continental Hospitals by Rieord Rostan,Jobert Vrlpeau, and others, surpasses everything hitherto etnoloyed tor ietpurity of the blood, spots,blotolies, pains and swellm it j % the joints, kidney, bladder, and urinary disease-strictur d'scharges, piles, gravel, pains in the back, theurnatisol,gout sieeplessnees.nervous and physical exhaustion,etc. Therapion is prepared in three different forms Nos. 1.2 and 3 according to oiseases for which intended. Full particulars send stamper!' atl!ireased envelope for pamphlet to MR. R. JOHNSON 43, HOLFORD-squARE, LONDo</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1903-12-24_WidnesExaminer_art0032" n="art0032">
        <head>" . • • • • – .4.0.1041, – • I. 0, , • .2*.a=,' • – • -' •••• – • '; • -*A• – • •</head>
