        <p>A strange experience befeltheHythrop Hounds while hunting near Woodstock. The fox ran into the Italian gardens of Blenheim Palace, followed by the hounds and most of the field. The huntsman tried to whip the hounds off, but did not succeed. The Hon. A. Brassey, master of the bunt was highly indignant at the trespass, and demanded, cap in band, a sovereign from each horseman ,in default of which be said he would take the hounds home: The demand was satisfied, and the sport was continued.</p>
